1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
and folds his arms.

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:01,680
Not tonight.

3
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:02,780
They don't go home.

4
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,260
They walk to the back of the line.

5
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,500
A man gets out of a taxi and joins the queue

6
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,900
without asking what it is for.

7
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,920
By 11, the line reaches the corner.

8
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,920
By midnight, it goes round the block

9
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,780
and people are offering the doorman money.

10
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:16,379
Only then does he nod and the rope comes up.

11
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,860
Inside, they cheer as if they have won something.

12
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,040
He pays his 40 strangers at the back door

13
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,020
and sends them home.

14
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,460
He never needs them again.

15
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,080
You see, nobody wants a seat in an empty room.

16
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,220
They want the seat somebody just told them

17
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,280
they could not have.

